      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_01",
          "content": "我把有挑战的情境看作成长和学习的机会。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_02",
          "content": "我会主动寻找可能需要深入思考某件事的情境。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_03",
          "content": "我喜欢学习自己不熟悉的主题。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_04",
          "content": "我觉得学习新信息很有吸引力。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_05",
          "content": "思考困难的概念性问题的解法，可能会让我夜里睡不着。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_06",
          "content": "我可能在一个问题上花上好几个小时，因为不知道答案就无法安心。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_07",
          "content": "如果想不出问题的解法，我会感到受挫，所以会更加努力地解决它。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_08",
          "content": "对于我觉得必须解决的问题，我会坚持不懈地钻研。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_09",
          "content": "哪怕一点点疑虑，也能让我不再寻求新的体验。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_10",
          "content": "我无法应对进入不确定情境所带来的压力。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_11",
          "content": "当我对自己的能力缺乏信心时，我觉得很难探索新的地方。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_12",
          "content": "当有可能发生令我措手不及的事情时，我很难集中注意力。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_13",
          "content": "我喜欢弄清楚人们为什么会那样行事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_14",
          "content": "我会问很多问题，以了解其他人对什么感兴趣。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_15",
          "content": "和一个兴奋的人交谈时，我会好奇是什么让对方兴奋。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 14,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_16",
          "content": "与人交谈时，我会尝试发现对方身上一些有趣的细节。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 15,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_17",
          "content": "其他人在交谈时，我喜欢弄清楚他们在谈什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 16,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_18",
          "content": "和其他人在一起时，我喜欢听他们的交谈。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 17,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_19",
          "content": "人们争吵时，我喜欢知道发生了什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 18,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_20",
          "content": "我会寻求有关我生活中那些人的私生活的信息。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 19,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_21",
          "content": "冒险让我感到兴奋。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 20,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_22",
          "content": "有空闲时间时，我想做一些有点吓人的事情。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 21,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_23",
          "content": "比起事先安排好的冒险，我觉得在过程中即兴展开的冒险要吸引人得多。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 22,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "DCR5_24",
          "content": "我更喜欢那些让人感到兴奋、难以预测的朋友。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 23,
          "responseSetKey": "dcr5_describes_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
